<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Drill results push Frontier, Anzoil up.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Drill results push Frontier, Anzoil up.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in oil and gas explorers Anzoil NL and Frontier Petroleum NL jumped in active trade on Friday after strong drilling results from the Song Thai Bin B10-1X well in the Hanoi Basin in onshore Vietnam.</p>
<p>By 3.50 p.m. (0550 GMT), Anzoil shares were 16 percent higher at 18.5 cents after reaching an intraday high of 20 cents on heavy trade of 11.9 million shares, while Frontier shares were 24 percent higher at 26 cents on turnover of 4.8 million shares.</p>
</text>
